VulkanMod Reforged

A Vulkan renderer for Minecraft 1.21.11 on NeoForge.
Experimental port. Compatibility and feature parity are incomplete.

Downloads: https://github.com/TrulyRin/VulkanMod-Reforged/releases
Build: ./gradlew assemble
Java: 21

An unofficial fork of https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod
